@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC-07 - View Session History

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "Desktop UI" as UI
participant "HistoryController" as Controller
participant "QuerySessionHistoryUseCase" as UseCase
participant "SessionQueryRepository" as Repo
participant "SessionMapper" as Mapper

Learner -> UI : open History and select date range
UI -> Controller : GET /api/v1/sessions?from=...&to=...&page=0&size=20
Controller -> UseCase : query(SessionHistoryQuery)
UseCase -> UseCase : validateRange()
UseCase -> Repo : findSummaries(range)
Repo --> UseCase : List<SessionSummary>
loop for each session
  UseCase -> Mapper : toSummary(session)
  Mapper --> UseCase : SessionSummaryDto
end
UseCase --> Controller : Page<SessionSummaryDto>
Controller --> UI : 200 OK\n{items, total, page, size}

note over Repo
  Read-only query. Uses a projection so the
  history screen does not load full aggregates
  or their interval collections.
end note

note over UI
  Filters: date range, session type, completed
  only. Sorting is newest first by default.
end note

@enduml
